							"raw": "{\n  \"statement_of_interest\": \"I am very interested in this research opportunity because of my background in machine learning and data analysis. I have completed relevant coursework including CS401 (Artificial Intelligence) and CS201 (Data Structures and Algorithms). I have hands-on experience with Python, TensorFlow, and scikit-learn from previous projects. I am particularly drawn to this research because it aligns with my career goals in AI and data science. I believe I can contribute meaningfully to this project while developing valuable research skills that will benefit my academic and professional growth.\"\n}"
